]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/26/business/warner-bros-discovery-paramount-deal-netflix.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Feb 2026 08:22:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Germany’s Oil and Gas Output Is Dwindling as Prices Rise</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/27/business/germanys-oil-and-gas-output-is-dwindling-as-prices-rise.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
