The Gas Nord production facility of Harbour Energy Germany in Langwedel-Holtebüttel.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/27/business/germanys-oil-and-gas-output-is-dwindling-as-prices-rise.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Feb 2026 06:35:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>What Larry and David Ellison Would Own After Warner Bros. Takeover</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/27/business/media/tech-tv-movies-and-news-ellisons-on-brink-of-colossal-empire.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
