OpenAI said it now has over 900 million weekly active users and more than 50 million paying subscribers.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/27/business/openai-funding.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Feb 2026 10:08:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Trump Media Explores Spinning Off Truth Social</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/27/business/trump-media-truth-social-spin-off.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
