The announcement named Texas Ventures Acquisition III, a Cayman Islands-based SPAC, as the company with which Truth Social would be merged.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/27/business/trump-media-truth-social-spin-off.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Feb 2026 10:13:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Pentagon-Anthropic Standoff Is a Decisive Moment for How A.I. Will Be Used in War</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/27/technology/defense-department-anthropic-ai-safety.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/02/27/multimedia/27biz-ai-military-pentagon-fthp/27biz-ai-military-pentagon-fthp-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" alt="Article image"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
The Pentagon has said that a private contractor cannot decide how its tools will be lawfully used for national security.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/27/technology/defense-department-anthropic-ai-safety.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Feb 2026 12:06:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Overlooked No More: Bobby Garnett, ‘Godfather’ of Vintage Dealers</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/27/obituaries/bobby-garnett-overlooked.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/02/23/multimedia/00garnett-hkpm/00garnett-hkpm-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" alt="Article image"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;His store, Bobby From Boston, transformed the way vintage men’s wear is sold, serving as a model for a generation of retailers.&lt;/p&gt;
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/27/obituaries/bobby-garnett-overlooked.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Feb 2026 09:40:04 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>How David Zaslav Pulled Off the Sale of Warner Bros. Discovery to Paramount</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/27/business/media/david-zaslav-warner-bros-discovery-paramount.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
