President Trump rebuked the Supreme Court again on Friday.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/27/business/trump-tariffs-refunds-supreme-court.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Feb 2026 18:22:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>In a Memoir Draft, Changpeng Zhao of Binance Details the Talks Leading to His Prison Time</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/27/technology/cz-changpeng-zhao-binance-memoir-prison.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
