Detail of the teeth of a drill bit that will be used in the next phase of drilling.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/28/business/germany-geothermal-renewable-energy.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Feb 2026 20:00:10 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>